UID:b7a5d614e577a0bab8c33989af3e66@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Explore the Sweet Side of Harvard Square! Join us on a fun don
 ut adventure through Harvard Square! Indulge your senses on a tantalizing 
 journey through the iconic Harvard Square\, where history meets deliciousn
 ess! Join us on the Harvard Square Donut Tour for a mouthwatering adventur
 e like no other. Discover hidden gems and beloved institutions as we trave
 rse the charming streets of Cambridge. Sample an array of artisanal donuts
  crafted with passion and precision by local bakeries. Try everything from
  mochi donuts to churros to greek donuts to the best doughnuts in Boston. 
 Savor the irresistible flavors of handcrafted donuts while soaking in the 
 vibrant atmosphere of one of Boston’s most iconic neighborhoods. Whether
  you’re a donut aficionado or simply seeking a sweet escape\, the Harvar
 d Square Donut Tour is the perfect way to satisfy your cravings and experi
 ence the magic of this historic enclave. You’ll hear fun stories about H
 arvard Square and the history of donuts on this guided walking tour. And y
 ou’ll even be able to take home a fun mug and sample some interesting co
 ffee pairings. Donut miss it! You’ll have a blast! Book your tour today 
 and treat yourself to a culinary experience you’ll never forget! Each to
 ur is a fun 90 minutes with plenty of treats and less than a mile of walki
 ng. We can’t wait to take you on a unique\, doughnut adventure! Where to
  meet: Meet in front of Smith Campus Center 1350 Massachusetts Avenue\, Ca
 mbridge\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/ev
 ent/harvard-square-cambridge-donut-tour/80355/
LOCATION:Off The Beaten Path Food Tours\, Harvard Square\, Cambridge\, MA
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/harvard-square-cambridge-donut-tour/8
 0355/
