 reedom Trail (Old North Church\, Faneuil Hall\, & more)\, Harvard Universi
 ty’s main campus in Cambridge\, the historic Boston harbor tour along th
 e Harborwalk\, and the Boston Ghost tour. This is the ultimate “must-do
