BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boston Chocolate Tour
DTSTART:20250412T000000
DTEND:20261227T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:ff69b14844dab59a8557ac4442ad51@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us on a sophisticated chocolate adventure through the mos
 t beautiful neighborhoods of Boston! Explore historic Beacon Hill and Bost
 on Common with us along with the Boston Public Market. Learn about the his
 tory of chocolate on this unique immersive adventure\, sampling a lot of c
 hocolate from truffles to a unique cacao tea to single origin bars to Bost
 on’s original cream pie! Whether you’re a local or a tourist to Boston
 \, you can’t miss this best Chocolate Tour in Boston. Take photos at the
  most instagrammable spots in Boston including the new Embrace sculpture a
 nd famous Acorn Street. Your taste buds and your eyes will be delighted by
  this unique experience you don’t want to miss as one of the top-rated t
 hings to do in Boston! Book the Boston Chocolate Tour today! After booking
 \, you'll receive tour guide meeting spot details.\n\nSources: Meet Boston
