BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Patriots Hall of Fame
DTSTART:20251122T000000
DTEND:20251122T020000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:b6d47e05905f3f30c2710d2467c417@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Patriots Hall of Fame presented by RTX is an exciting\, in
 novative and interactive\, modern museum experience for all ages. The Kraf
 t family\, in an effort to preserve team history and honor the greatest Pa
 triots of all-time\, built and opened The Hall in 2008. It has since under
 gone championship renovations to enhance its Super Bowl Experience exhibit
 \, which takes guests inside the team’s six Super Bowl wins. The Hall of
  Fame includes the sparkling Vince Lombardi Super Bowl trophies and champi
 onship rings\, an interactive that allows guests to virtually make Malcolm
  Butler’s Super Bowl XLIX-clinching interception\, and the Anatomy of a 
 Comeback area that breaks down the Super Bowl LI win. The Hall regularly a
 dds to its collection and changes out artifacts and exhibits to ensure a f
 resh experience. Upcoming Adjusted Hours (as of November 17\, 2025): Thank
 sgiving (Thursday\, November 27) – CLOSED Monday\, December 1 | 10:00 AM
  – 1:30 PM Sunday\, December 14 | 3:30 PM – 6:00 PM TBD Week 18 Game |
  3:30 PM – 6:00 PM\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meet
 boston.com/event/the-patriots-hall-of-fame/88202/
LOCATION:Patriot Place\, Two Patriot Place\, Foxborough\, MA\, 02035
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-patriots-hall-of-fame/88202/
END:VEVENT
