DESCRIPTION:Explore major Massachusetts events in the first year of the Am
 erican Revolution at the Old State House\, where protest turned into actio
 n and the momentum for independence accelerated. Created through a partner
 ship between Revolutionary Spaces and the Massachusetts Historical Society
 \, The Road to Revolution: Massachusetts and the Independence Movement inv
 ites visitors to step into 1775 and 1776—a moment defined by uncertainty
 \, debate\, and decisions that would reshape the world.\n\nSources: Meet B
