 tion since 1997. Setting the bench mark for similar tours\, Haunted Footst
 eps Ghost Tour is the preeminent evening activity in Salem\, Massachusetts
 . Our engaging guides creatively convey Salem's authentic haunted history.
  Delve into Salem's macabre past as our knowledgable and charismatic guide
 s regale you with true tales of documented paranormal activity\, accidenta
 l death and centuries old murder. Salem is a 30-minute ride from Boston on
  the Newburyport/Rockport train from North Station (where the Bruins and C
 eltics play). There are late trains back to Boston after the tour. Come up
  for the day and take a morning ferry to Salem and then the train back at 
 night Our walking tours give you a wonderful perspective of our quaint cit
 y. We bring you throughout the downtown area as well as the McIntire Distr
 ict. TOURS RUN RAIN OR SHINE. NO REFUNDS. We do not go inside any building
 s\, dogs are allowed on our tours\, with the exception of the cemetery and
  access to tour locations is subject to city regulations. A confirmation a
 nd details on meeting location in Salem will be sent to you via email imme
 diately after booking. Come get spooked in Salem... CLICK HERE TO LEARN MO
 RE OR PURCHASE TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.me
 etboston.com/event/haunted-footsteps-ghost-tour/86312/
