 vers and embrace possibility. Whether you're new to the city or a local Ga
 rdner devotee\, join us as often as you like\, as each visit becomes a new
  opportunity to meet others and get creative in a space of belonging and e
 xploration. Bring a date\, bring a friend\, or come by yourself—let the 
 Gardner Museum be your respite\, art studio\, and home away from home on T
 hursday nights. Advance registration is highly recommended for free\, time
 d entry. Registration for each Free Thursday Night opens two days before\,
