DESCRIPTION:Experience the country's funniest stand-up comedians\, right i
 n the heart of Boston's bustling Back Bay neighborhood! Named a “Critic
 ’s Pick” in The Boston Globe\, our shows regularly feature headlining 
 performers who've appeared on Netflix\, HBO\, and Hulu\, to name a few. Of
 fering delicious bold cocktails and crave worthy bites\, The 88 Club provi
 des a vibrant & friendly atmosphere that’s perfect for date nights\, wor
 k outings\, and meet-up's with old friends. With new comedy lineup's every
  week and frequent surprise guests from NYC and L.A.\, you never know who 
 might drop in - you've just gotta get your tickets before they're gone!\n
 \nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/comed
