 escott Street in inclement weather. Accessibility accommodations: Email am
 _register@harvard.edu at least 48 hours in advance\, including the name an
 d date of the program in the subject line. Join us for an evening of art\,
  fun\, food\, and more! Conservators will be coming out from behind the sc
 enes for a night of creative surprises. Gather with friends and mingle ins
 ide our spectacular Italian-inspired courtyard\, evoking the energy of a b
 ustling town piazza. DJ C-Zone will set the mood with smooth\, curated sou
 nds as you chat\, snack\, sip\, and catch up over bites and drinks availab
 le for purchase from local vendors. Drop in on a Spotlight Tour\, browse t
 he museum shop\, and stop by the Materials Lab for a fun art-making activi
 ty. The galleries are yours to explore\, with more than 50 spaces filled w
 ith world-class art. There are prizes to be won\, friends to be made\, and
  favorite artworks to be found! Don’t forget to check out our current ex
 hibitions. Harvard Art Museums at Night takes place the last Thursday of e
 very month (holidays permitting)\, from 5 to 9pm. Each night features a ne
 w mix of local talent and community partners to make this a festive occasi
 on for all. LEARN MORE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.me
 etboston.com/event/harvard-art-museums-at-night/92493/
