DESCRIPTION:Step into the American Revolution like never before! Relive 17
 76 is a 5-part guided AR tour along Boston's Freedom Trail\, bringing hist
 ory to life through immersive AR and XR experiences. Help the Sons of Libe
 rty fight back against the tea import tax Witness historical events unfold
  where they once happened Fire historically accurate cannons for freedom f
 rom tyranny! Choose from 3 Experiences: Fully guided walking tour of the F
 reedom Trail 2-hour\, small group tour with a guide See all 16 Freedom Tra
 il sites 5 interactive Augmented Reality (AR) experiences done at 4 differ
 ent sites Augmented Reality: Skip the walking tour and jump into XR 5 inte
 ractive 3D AR and XR experiences done all in one place (30 min) Play out t
 he story of America's founding with XR headsets Bunker Hill Cannon: Our Mo
 st Popular XR Experience Fire a field cannon from the Battle of Bunker Hil
 l Choose between Fun Mode and Historic Mode (or both) LEARN MORE / BUY TIC
 KETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event
 /relive-1776/92954/
