BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fireside at The Current
DTSTART:20260925T000000
DTEND:20270131T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:d08f5a51059fe6721ed27971cb3d49@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Current returns to Boston Seaport on September 25 with a w
 arm new theme for its 20th season: Fireside at The Current\, bringing a co
 zy cold-weather retreat to Seaport Common. A lodge-inspired setting inspir
 ed by the comfort and connection of gathering around a fire\, the latest s
 eason brings together nine pop-ups spanning apparel\, accessories\, jewelr
 y\, beauty\, performance gear and sweet treats. Open September 25\, 2026 t
 hrough January 31\, 2027\, the pop-up village along Seaport Common will on
 ce again create a lively destination for discovering emerging concepts\, l
 ocal businesses and returning favorites. To celebrate opening day\, Boston
  Seaport will host a free kickoff event at Seaport Common on Friday\, Sept
 ember 25 from 4pm to 6pm. Visitors can explore the season’s nine pop-ups
  while enjoying a build-your-own s’mores station\, hot cocoa topping bar
 \, sparkling cider mocktails and festive activities throughout the village
 . Learn more here. Fireside at The Current reimagines the seasonal storefr
 onts for the cooler months\, which are draped in a rich green and studded 
 with a modern quilt pattern. The experience invites visitors to step insid
 e\, explore\, enjoy a treat\, and discover something new in the heart of t
 he neighborhood.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetbost
 on.com/event/fireside-at-the-current/93270/
LOCATION:Seaport\, 85 Northern Avenue\, Boston\, MA\, 02110
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/fireside-at-the-current/93270/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Greenhouse Dinner Series
DTSTART:20260925T000000
DTEND:20260925T020000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:445856447273c1bca99f1733d02ee1@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Dine beneath the stars in the enchanting setting of the Chatha
 m Bars Inn Greenhouse. Join us for an unforgettable evening at the Farm\, 
 where seasonal flavors\, fresh local ingredients and great company come to
 gether for a one-of-a-kind dining experience. The Chatham Bars Inn Greenho
 use Dinner Series returns on September 25\, 2026\, inviting guests to enjo
 y a thoughtfully crafted farm-to-table meal surrounded by the natural beau
 ty of the greenhouse. Gather around the table\, savor each dish and celebr
 ate the flavors of the season. Details Fridays\, September 25 – November
  6\, 2026 5:00–8:00 PM Ages 21+ $225 per person (includes alcohol\, tax
 \, and gratuity) Location: Chatham Bars Inn Farm\, 3034 Main Street\, Brew
 ster\, MA 02631 Dietary restrictions must be communicated to the Chatham B
 ars Inn team ahead of the event. Please provide all allergies or dietary r
 estrictions at least 48 hours in advance . Cancellations made 72 hours or 
 more in advance incur no charge. Cancellations within 48-72 hours will res
