 r if they would like. 10:00–11:00 AM: Craft & Activity 11:00 AM: Venue O
 pens for regularly scheduled business and Bowling is available for reserva
 tion. Food and beverage purchases can be made at this time. Reservations f
 or bowling are encouraged. Kids receive a Sprouts membership card when the
 y join and earn a stamp for every monthly event they attend. Birthday Mont
 h Get a Sprouts Kids Club T-shirt + 50% off bowling for any birthday party
 . Must be used during the child’s birthday month. Grow With Us Attend 6 
 Events: Earn a free 1 hour of bowling Attend 12 Events: Celebrate your Bir
 thday with a free birthday party for up to 25 guests. This includes the re
