 e held remotely with BASE instructors. On the registration form\, you will
  indicate remote\, in-person or either option. >Intensive group courses ar
 e offered a couple times a year. Find out more. Boston Area Spanish Exchan
 ge\, BASE\, is a teacher-founded and teacher-run language school in Boston
