DESCRIPTION:Carrie Nation Restaurant & Cocktail Club is introducing Saturd
 ay afternoon tea at its Beacon Hill location. Served every Saturday from 1
  to 4 p.m.\, the experience is $35 per person. Guests can choose from a co
 llection of classic and specialty teas\, paired with freshly baked fruit s
 cones served with house preserves and cream\, finger sandwiches featuring 
 tuna\, chicken and cucumber\, and the chef’s selection of petit fours. T
 wo afternoon tea cocktails are also available for $16 each. The Velvet Pet
 al combines Gunpowder Fig gin\, lemon\, lime\, basil and hibiscus foam. Th
 e Countess features New Amsterdam vodka\, passion fruit\, Earl Grey tea an
 d lemon. Set inside Carrie Nation’s Prohibition-inspired space near the 
 Massachusetts State House\, afternoon tea offers a relaxed way to gather w
 ith friends\, celebrate a special occasion or enjoy a Saturday afternoon t
 reat.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/even
 t/afternoon-tea-on-beacon-hill/93681/
