UID:12ea4137942604fa12e6284f3f8031@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:B-Girls: Global K-Pop Idol is a large-scale\, women led pop pr
 oduction that explores K-Pop as a global cultural movement shaped by cross
  border collaboration\, musical diversity\, and contemporary performance d
 esign centered around dance vocals. B-Girls\, Berklee’s one and only K-P
 op idol collective\, operates as a student-run interdisciplinary productio
 n group involving performers\, producers\, songwriters\, and creative dire
 ctors from Berklee College\, choreographers and dancers from the Boston Co
 nservatory\, and business minds from Music Business and B.A. in MILI major
 s. This concert will feature original music alongside reimagined K-Pop arr
 angements\, live band integration\, choreography\, and multimedia elements
  that reflect the fusion of K-Pop traditions with Berklee-trained musician
 ship. The performance represents the culmination of B-Girls’ growing reg
 ional presence across Greater Boston and a highlight on cultural diversity
 . With established media coverage and a cross campus audience base\, this 
 event aims to present a polished production that highlights experiential l
 earning\, female creative leadership\, and the power of global pop to mean
 ingfully intersect with local communities. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSou
 rces: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/b-girls%3a
 -global-k-pop-idol/93462/
LOCATION:Berklee Performance Center\, 136 Massachusetts Avenue\, Boston\, 
 MA\, 02115
