 bers of the Outlaws\, Marshall Tucker Band\, Foghat\, Allman Brothers and 
 Dicky Betts Band to name a few The band is constantly evolving as members 
 come and go depending on tour commitments so every show is different with 
 changing set lists The current line up if fronted by legendary guitarist/v
 ocalist Chris Hicks of the Marshall Tucker Band/Outlaws. Chris has been on
  the road with Marshall Tucker for the past 29 years and before that was i
 n the Outlaws with original OaO bassist Jeff Howell Get ready for a night 
 of Tucker and Outlaws classics as well as some deep cuts for the die hard 
 fan.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/ev
 ent/once-an-outlaw/
