DTEND:20261029T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:f16ddc213a313873411e1d57ed00e6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This October\, The Moth Mainstage tour returns to Boston with 
 a night of unforgettable stories. Making one-night-only stops around the w
 orld each season\, the Mainstage is the preeminent Moth experience. This c
 urated evening features five beloved storytellers\, a notable host\, and a
  guest musician. Featured storytellers have included Padma Lakshmi\, Malco
 lm Gladwell\, Molly Ringwald\, Salman Rushdie\, Elizabeth Gilbert\, Hasan 
 Minhaj\, Kathleen Turner\, Darryl “DMC” McDaniels\, John Turturro\, Bo
 ots Riley\, Mike Birbiglia\, Rosanne Cash\, Liz Phair\, and Tig Notaro\, a
 s well as an astronaut\, a pickpocket\, a hot­dog eating champion and tho
 usands more. If you’ve ever lost yourself in The Moth Radio Hour \, or h
 ad a “driveway moment” listening to The Moth Podcast \, this is your o
 pportunity to experience what it feels like to be in the room.\n\nSources:
  Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-moth-mainst
 age/91169/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02116
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-moth-mainstage/91169/
