UID:9717d3fcab1c50341c112a8336297b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:SWT is an 8-piece powerhouse tribute act celebrating the music
  of Eric Clapton and George Harrison with unparalleled energy and precisio
 n. Their performances blend faithful recreations of classic recordings wit
 h nuanced interpretations\, capturing the fire of Clapton’s blues-infuse
 d rock and the mystique of Harrison’s soulful melodies. With a lineup of
  passionate and skilled musicians\, SWT delivers searing guitar solos\, fi
 nely crafted arrangements\, and a stage presence that commands attention. 
 Their commitment to detail ensures that every note\, harmony\, and groove 
