BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boston Birding with Family
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:cf84d2cbb4df899158ed01c35b2dd4@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Explore the unexpected world of Boston birds together with you
 r family. Walk the trails of the Boston Nature Center\, learning to spot a
 nd identify local residents and seasonal visitors by their behaviors\, fie
 ld marks\, and calls. With weekly sessions throughout the fall\, each visi
 t offers a timely opportunity to learn more about migration\, habitat\, an
 d survival strategies\, giving kids and adults alike a richer picture of t
 he birds living alongside us in the city. You'll also learn how to make th
 e most of apps like Merlin and eBird\, connecting you to a global online c
 ommunity of citizen scientists and an easy way to take the adventure home 
 with you. Binoculars and field guides are provided\, so all you need to br
 ing is curiosity. Registration is required. LEARN MORE / REGISTER\n\nSourc
 es: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/boston-birdi
 ng-with-family/93693/
LOCATION:Mass Audubon's Boston Nature Center\, Mass Audubon's Boston Natur
 e Center 500 Walk Hill Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02126
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/boston-birding-with-family/93693/
END:VEVENT
