BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dia de los Muertos Community Ofrenda
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:b9f2f2f12e76ffe5fb51a793c7d5d3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:New England Donor Services (NEDS) will partner with the Veroni
 ca Robles Cultural Center for a Day of the Dead (“Día de los Muertos”
 ) Remembrance Program on Saturday\, October 31st at the ICA Watershed in E
 ast Boston. This free\, public event from 11 a.m. to 12 p.m. ET will featu
 re a display of traditional ofrendas (altars) honoring deceased loved ones
 . As part of a special remembrance ceremony\, NEDS will present an ofrenda
  with photos of organ donors to pay tribute to those who have given the gi
 ft of life through organ donation\, while also raising awareness about the
  vital need for organ donors. Día de los Muertos is an annual Mexican obs
 ervance\, also celebrated throughout Latin America and in several parts of
  the U.S.\, where families remember and welcome the souls of their decease
 d relatives for a celebratory reunion. The observance is usually celebrate
 d from October 31st to November 3rd. The Remembrance Program will include 
 the exhibition of ofrendas in addition to musical performances\, art-makin
 g workshops\, lectures\, and more. The NEDS ofrenda will be on display fro
 m October 31st to November 2nd. LEARN MORE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent 
 page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-community-ofrend
 a/93908/
LOCATION:ICA Watershed 256 Marginal Street Boston\, MA\, 02128\, ICA Water
 shed 256 Marginal Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02128
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-community-ofrenda/
 93908/
END:VEVENT
