BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Houdini Halloween Magic Show and Curator Talk
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:40df48bb188a8d4367647a3a74fe41@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:October 31 marks the 100th anniversary of the death of the gre
 at magician and escapologist Harry Houdini. To commemorate this historic o
 ccasion\, Anton Andresen\, the Official Magician of Salem\, Massachusetts
 \, will present a selection of mysteries inspired by Houdini's extraordina
 ry life and legendary career. Experience what it might have felt like to w
 itness the world's master mystifier through astonishing demonstrations tha
 t capture the wonder and excitement of Houdini's performances. Curator Geo
 rge Schwartz will offer a short historical introduction about Houdini's co
 nnections to PEM and Salem. Discover how Houdini's passion for handcuffs\,
  escapes and the art of illusion intersected with the city's rich history 
 and the museum’s collections. A pair of handcuffs that Houdini saw when 
 he visited PEM in 1906 will be on view September 3 - November 2\, 2026 in 
 the Main Atrium\, along with other items related to his performances in Sa
 lem. Listen to Anton perform some of his illusions on the PEMcast. LEARN M
 ORE HERE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/e
 vent/houdini-halloween-magic-show-and-curator-talk/93192/
LOCATION:Peabody Essex Museum\, 161 Essex Street\, Salem\, MA\, 01970
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/houdini-halloween-magic-show-and-cura
 tor-talk/93192/
END:VEVENT
