 ber 2nd and end the week of December 19th. Boston is an exciting place\, p
 articularly culturally and linguistically\, and we are pleased to present 
 BASE to you in your search for Spanish language acquisition and skills wit
 h Spanish conversation in Boston\, as well as in our effort to bridge cult
 ural and linguistic gaps in the Boston area and beyond. In-person and onli
 ne courses available. Boston Area Spanish Exchange\, BASE\, is a teacher-f
 ounded and teacher-run Spanish school in Boston\, MA. We are bilinguals\, 
 linguists\, and experienced Spanish teachers passionate about languages\, 
 teaching\, and learning. Register now! -- BASE will also be hosting a hand
 ful of FREE conversation workshops\, game nights in Portuguese\, and other
  fun events. Private classes in Spanish and other languages are also offer
 ed.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/
 affordable-portuguese-classes-in-boston/78595/
LOCATION:Boston Area Spanish Exchange (BASE)\, 101 Arch Street 8th Floor\,
  Boston\, MA\, 02110
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/affordable-portuguese-classes-in-bost
 on/78595/
END:VEVENT
