BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Music of Hey Arnold! Feat. Jim Lang and The PS 118 AllStars wi
 th Special Guest Craig Bartlett
DTSTART:20261102T000000
DTEND:20261102T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:d7ee7ff3dab42e213a286d01f15790@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Music of Hey Arnold! Live featuring Jim Lang & The PS 118 
 AllStars celebrates the 30th anniversary of one of television's most cheri
 shed animated series. Led by award winning composer Jim Lang\, best known 
 for his unforgettable theme music\, original songs\, and score for Hey Arn
 old!\, this one of a kind concert brings the music of the series to life o
 n stage. Blending jazz\, hip hop\, blues\, R&B and funk\, Lang created a s
 ound unlike anything else on television\, helping give Hey Arnold! its hea
 rt\, warmth\, humor and soul. Thirty years later\, the music continues to 
 connect with fans of all ages and inspire musicians around the world. Perf
 ormed by Jim Lang and The PS 118 AllStars\, the evening features the show'
 s unforgettable themes\, fan favorite songs\, and some of the moments that
  made Hey Arnold! so special. Accompanied by multimedia visuals and storie
 s from behind the music\, the performance also includes a special guest ap
 pearance by series creator Craig Bartlett. Whether you grew up with Hey Ar
 nold! or are discovering its music for the first time\, this 30th annivers
 ary celebration is a chance to experience one of animation's most distinct
 ive and enduring scores performed live by the composer who created it.\n\n
 Sources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-mus
 ic-of-hey-arnold!-feat-jim-lang-and-the-ps-118-allstars-with-special-guest
 -craig-bartlett/92602/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02116
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-music-of-hey-arnold!-feat-jim-lan
 g-and-the-ps-118-allstars-with-special-guest-craig-bartlett/92602/
END:VEVENT
