DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:a62cea2758477282e3ae7c21e3ccf3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Berklee Asia Rising (BAR) highlights the people\, places\, and
  stories shaping Asian and Asian American music today. Representing commun
 ities across East Asia\, Southeast Asia\, South Asia\, Central Asia\, and 
 the Asian American diaspora\, this concert showcases original projects\, a
 rtist-led collaborations\, and performances inspired by the music\, creato
 rs\, and cultural influences shaping audiences around the world. Founded b
 y Edvard Lee\, associate professor of ensembles\, BAR brings together a ne
 w generation of artists whose perspectives reflect the diversity\, creativ
 ity\, and global reach of contemporary music today. At its core\, the prog
 ram celebrates students not only as performers\, but as creators\, collabo
 rators\, and emerging leaders. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet B
 oston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/berklee-asia-rising/93
 461/
