DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:893653b3036b3ea8162729e5069aae@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The sustainability reporting landscape continues to evolve rap
 idly. With significant developments related to the European Sustainability
  Reporting Standards (ESRS)\, shifting regulatory expectations\, and upcom
 ing disclosure requirements\, many organizations are reassessing their rep
 orting strategies and priorities. Join Sustainserv for a Lunch & Learn whe
 re we’ll discuss the latest changes\, share practical insights\, and hel
 p organizations get up to speed on what these developments mean for future
  reporting obligations. Whether you’re already reporting under ESRS\, pr
 eparing for future requirements\, or simply trying to stay ahead of the ch
 anging regulatory environment\, this session is designed to provide a valu
 able update and opportunity for discussion. We’ll discuss: Recent ESRS d
 evelopments and updates Upcoming reporting requirements and regulatory cha
 nges Practical implications for reporting teams Open discussion and peer n
 etworking Come learn\, ask questions\, and connect with fellow sustainabil
 ity professionals over lunch (provided). Seats are limited\, and your regi
 stration does not guarantee entry. The event host will reach out to confir
 m your invitation. LEARN MORE / REGISTER\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent pa
 ge: https://www.meetboston.com/event/sustainserv-lunch-%26-learn%3a-esrs-a
 nd-emerging-reporting-requirements/93401/
