DTEND:20261107T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:0e1ec397c12a05afc7c02bd7d2193d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Performing Arts Center\, Brewster Dr. Spyridon Antonopoulos pr
 ovides a window into the mystical sounds of Byzantine chant\, the sacred m
 usic of the Eastern church - exploring both the oral and written tradition
 s as they developed from ancient Christian communities up until his presen
 t day work as a scholar and performer. This form of sung prayer will lift 
 your spririt as it has throughout the ages. Free admission for all. Info: 
 508-240-2400 | artsempoweringlife.org\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent 
 page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/lost-voices-of-byzantium/52600/
