BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wôpanâak Language Reclamation Project with jessie little doe
  baird
DTSTART:20261107T000000
DTEND:20261107T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:d70f36a56cab8ccbe207a117758023@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join jessie little doe baird\, linguist and co-founder of the 
 Wôpanâak Language Reclamation Project\, for a talk on the Wampanoag peop
 le’s journey to reclaim their language after more than a century without
  living fluent speakers. She will share how Wôpanâak returned to communi
 ty life\, what this work has meant for her people\, and what the language 
 can teach us about seeing the world through a Wampanoag lens.\n\nSources: 
 Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/the-w%c
 3%b4pan%c3%a2ak-language-reclamation-project-with-jessie-little-doe-baird/
 52644/
