 ia: Jewelry\, ceramics\, textiles\, woodworking\, glass\, paper goods\, ph
 otography\, small sculpture\, mixed media\, holiday-themed work\, and more
  – Pricing: A range of affordable\, giftable price points encouraged. Fe
 atured Event: Ladies’ Night. Participating work will be highlighted duri
