DESCRIPTION:Gather around the table for an evening of Mahjong at Wequasset
 t. Whether you are learning the game for the first time or looking to enjo
 y a few rounds with fellow players\, this welcoming experience offers the 
 perfect opportunity to learn\, connect\, and try something new. Join us in
