DESCRIPTION:Lake Austin at Wequassett A Wellness Retreat Step away from th
 e everyday and into a restorative retreat inspired by the renowned Lake Au
 stin Spa Resort. Join us at Wequassett for a thoughtfully curated wellness
  experience designed to nourish the body\, quiet the mind\, and create spa
 ce to reconnect with yourself. Over the course of the retreat\, immerse yo
 urself in movement\, mindfulness\, nourishing experiences\, and moments of
  stillness\, all surrounded by the natural beauty of Cape Cod. From peacef
 ul mornings to restorative practices and time spent overlooking Pleasant B
 ay\, each moment invites you to slow down\, breathe deeply\, and embrace a
  more intentional pace. Whether you join us for a personal reset or share 
 the experience with someone special\, Lake Austin at Wequassett offers a c
 hance to step away\, recharge\, and return feeling refreshed and renewed. 
 Come for the retreat. Leave with a renewed sense of balance. View details 
 here: https://wequassett.com/experience/lake-austin-at-wequassett-wellness
