BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Northshore Line Dancing
DTSTART:20261118T183000
DTEND:20261118T203000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:f7018151a23ab93fc428296483654f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun night out\, great music\, and a welcoming co
 mmunity? Join Northshore Line Dancing for an evening filled with energy\, 
 laughter\, movement\, and easy-to-follow dances for all levels. Whether yo
 u’re brand new or already love to dance\, this is your chance to move\, 
 connect\, and have fun in a relaxed and uplifting atmosphere.\n\nSources: 
 North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/northshore-li
 ne-dancing/2026-11-18/
