DESCRIPTION:The 2024 annual Lighting On The Hill will take place on Wednes
 day\, November 25 from 3 p.m. to 5:30 p.m at the Pilgrim Monument and Prov
 incetown Museum. This year’s lighting will be held in person atop High P
 ole Hill and everyone is welcome to this free community event. There will 
 be a DJ and a cash bar selling adult and kid-friendly drinks as well as sn
 acks. The lights will go on at 5:00 p.m. The community can enter the groun
 ds via the inclined elevator on Bradford Street or PMPM's High Pole Hill R
 oad entrance.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capeco
 dchamber.org/event/annual-lighting-of-the-pilgrim-monument/47052/
