BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Between Season's: Off Season Tours at the Museums on the Green
DTSTART:20261128T000000
DTEND:20261128T000000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:4e56d5d361a1c8dc3d79eeb5da4b80@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Between Seasons: Off-Season Tours at the Museums on the Green 
 Discover Falmouth’s historic homes and gardens in the calm of the off-se
 ason. Step into Falmouth’s historic homes during the quieter months with
  Between the Seasons\, our off-season tour series at the Museums on the Gr
 een. Enjoy an intimate\, guided exploration of the Wicks House\, Conant Ho
 use\, and Cultural Center American Revolution exhibition in a peaceful set
 ting\, hear the stories of the families who lived here\, and enjoy a more 
 intimate look at our preserved space beyond the summer crowds. It’s the 
 perfect way to discover local history at a slower\, reflective pace. Free 
 Admission. Come anytime during our open hours. Self-guided exhibit touring
  in 2 houses\, and docent-led tours of our 1790 Dr. Wicks House. You will 
 find our tour guides & volunteers in the Hallet Barn Visitor’s Center & 
 Whaling Wives Gift Shop. Kids Activities: -Village Green Scavenger Hunt bo
 oklet -Activity Backpack full of games -Wicks House scavenger hunt Visit u
 s from 10am-2pm on the following dates: November 28th\, 2026 December 5th
 \, 2026 – Wreath Sale & Holiday Market day!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber
 \nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/between-seasons%3a-off-
 season-tours-at-the-museums-on-the-green/52637/
LOCATION:Falmouth Museums on the Green\, 55 & 65 Palmer Avenue\, Falmouth
 \, MA\, 02540
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/between-seasons%3a-off-season-tou
 rs-at-the-museums-on-the-green/52637/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beverly’s Inaugural Holiday Pops Concert
DTSTART:20261128T190000
DTEND:20261128T210000
DTSTAMP:20261029T174705Z
UID:84194cdb4a61cc08efd93c1d5b4bd4@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A true Boston-quality holiday concert—right at home in Bever
 ly. ​Experience the magic of a full 35-piece professional orchestra\, le
 d by internationally renowned conductor Dr. Dirk Hillyer. ​Celebrate the
  season with a spectacular evening of live orchestral music at the histori
 c Larcom Theatre. The Dirk Hillyer Festival Orchestra brings the excitemen
 t and musicianship of a big-city Holiday Pops concert to the North Shore f
 or Beverly’s inaugural Holiday Pops celebration. This high-energy\, hear
 twarming holiday performance is fun for the whole family\, featuring belov
 ed seasonal favorites\, audience sing-alongs\, and show-stopping performan
 ces by professional soloists. Expect a few surprises along the way—inclu
 ding a special visit from Santa himself! ​It’s the perfect way to kick
  off the holiday season with friends\, family\, and community. Classic hol
 iday cheer\, Broadway-level musicianship\, and a historic hometown theatre
 .​ Age Recommendation: All ages Proud to welcome soloists Nathan Seavey 
 and Bethany Vahn to accompany the orchestra for several holiday favorites.
  Thelarcom.org/holidaypops\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https:
