 d to bringing the timeless music of Fleetwood Mac to life. With a passion 
 for preserving the iconic sound of one of rock’s most beloved bands\, Li
 ttle Lies takes audiences on a journey through the legendary catalog displ
 aying Fleetwood Mac in their prime with a fresh take on their classic vibe
 . The band also faithfully recreates their greatest hits with precision\, 
 power\, and heart.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northo
